WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.656
Rapunzel stared down at the witch.

2
00:00:04.657 --> 00:00:10.004
The witch could not get into the tower.

3
00:00:10.005 --> 00:00:13.794
But Rapunzel had an idea.

4
00:00:13.795 --> 00:00:16.773
Rapunzel leaned out the window.

5
00:00:16.774 --> 00:00:24.615
Then she dropped her long hair down.

6
00:00:24.616 --> 00:00:28.384
"Climb up!" she called.

7
00:00:28.385 --> 00:00:34.640
The witch snorted. "I'm too old for climbing."

8
00:00:34.641 --> 00:00:38.569
"Just try!" Rapunzel said.

9
00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:43.042
The witch looked scared, but she grabbed the hair.

10
00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:47.157
Rapunzel pulled.

11
00:00:47.158 --> 00:00:52.575
Slowly the witch began to rise.

12
00:00:52.576 --> 00:00:57.126
The witch closed her eyes. "I'm dizzy!

13
00:00:57.127 --> 00:01:01.135
This was a bad idea!"

14
00:01:01.136 --> 00:01:05.314
"Hold on tightly!" Rapunzel called.

15
00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:10.850
Rapunzel kept pulling on the braid.

16
00:01:10.851 --> 00:01:14.060
Finally . . . thunk!

17
00:01:14.061 --> 00:01:18.750
The witch landed inside the tower!

18
00:01:18.751 --> 00:01:22.519
The prince was hiding nearby.

19
00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:26.793
He watched the witch get into the tower.

20
00:01:26.794 --> 00:01:31.868
"Please?" his servant whispered. "Can we go?"

21
00:01:31.869 --> 00:01:34.390
"No," the prince said.

22
00:01:34.391 --> 00:01:37.923
"I must talk to that girl!"

23
00:01:37.924 --> 00:01:53.766
The prince waited until the witch was gone.

24
00:01:53.767 --> 00:02:00.120
After dark Rapunzel heard a strange voice.

25
00:02:00.121 --> 00:02:05.151
"Who's there?" She looked out the window.

26
00:02:05.152 --> 00:02:10.171
A young man stood below.

27
00:02:10.172 --> 00:02:14.270
"Do I know you?" she asked.

28
00:02:14.271 --> 00:02:16.521
The man nodded.

29
00:02:16.522 --> 00:02:20.243
"We met a long time ago at the market."

30
00:02:20.244 --> 00:02:29.074
He stepped into the moonlight.

31
00:02:29.075 --> 00:02:34.102
Rapunzel gasped. "You're the prince!

32
00:02:34.103 --> 00:02:37.361
I see you at the palace!"

33
00:02:37.362 --> 00:02:45.957
Rapunzel let down her hair.

34
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:55.110
The prince climbed up.

35
00:02:55.111 --> 00:02:59.710
"What are you doing in the forest?" Rapunzel asked.

36
00:02:59.711 --> 00:03:03.273
"I like to walk in the woods," the prince said.

37
00:03:03.274 --> 00:03:08.199
"Sometimes I hear someone singing."

38
00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:40.314
Rapunzel smiled and sang softly.

39
00:03:40.315 --> 00:03:44.095
"You are the singer!" the prince cried.

40
00:03:44.096 --> 00:03:48.132
"But why are you locked in this tower?"

41
00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:55.448
Rapunzel told him about the witch.

42
00:03:55.449 --> 00:04:00.412
The prince frowned and paced the room.

43
00:04:00.413 --> 00:04:03.325
"The witch cannot keep you here!

44
00:04:03.326 --> 00:04:07.063
My servant will fetch a ladder.

45
00:04:07.064 --> 00:04:11.883
And soon you will be free!"

